---
---

<section id="nosotros" class="relative py-32 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">
          Sobre nosotros
        </h2>
        <h3 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          Código que genera resultados
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          No somos solo programadores. Somos partners tecnológicos que entienden
          tu negocio y traducen tus objetivos en soluciones de software que
          realmente funcionan.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary-light">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-semibold">Código limpio y documentado</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Estándares de la industria que facilitan el mantenimiento y la escalabilidad.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary-light">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-semibold">Comunicación transparente</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Updates constantes, demos semanales y cero sorpresas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary-light">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-semibold">Entrega a tiempo</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Metodologías ágiles que garantizan plazos realistas y cumplidos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-surface-light p-8">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface p-6 text-center">
              <div class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-light">Node.js</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">Backend</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface p-6 text-center">
              <div class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-accent">PostgreSQL</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">Base de datos</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface p-6 text-center">
              <div class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-primary">React</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">Frontend</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-surface p-6 text-center">
              <div class="mb-2 text-3xl font-bold text-primary-dark">Docker</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-text-muted">DevOps</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 -z-10 h-full w-full rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/15 to-accent/15 blur-xl"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
